Algorithm: J. Chang, H. Kang and M. G. Kang, "Correction of Axial and Lateral Chromatic Aberration With False Color Filtering", IEEE Transactions on Image Processing, 2013.
Reference implementation: T. Eboli, "Fast Chromatic Aberration Correction with 1D Filters", Image Processing On Line 13 (2023), https://doi.org/10.5201/ipol.2023.443, under the license below.

